    <string name="settings_help">Help</string>
    <string name="settings_help_desc">Learn how to use the app</string>
    <string name="settings_help_body">• Use the menu icon in the top-left to switch between Dictionary, Quiz, Favorites and Profile.\n\n• Use the moon/sun icon in the top-right to toggle light and dark theme.\n\n• On the Dictionary screen, search for words; from the settings menu you can switch between synonyms, verbs, adjectives, idioms and nouns.\n\n• Words not found locally can be searched via TDK Güncel Türkçe Sözlük online.\n\n• Add words to favorites, practice with Quiz, and review with learning cards from favorites.\n\n• In Profile you can access language selection, statistics and the About section (update, rate, share, privacy policy).</string>
